# ==================
#
#  CUSTOM
#
#  put below your custom ignore rules
#  for example , if you want to include a
#  module directly in repositoryyou can do:
#
#  !modules/yourmodule
#
# ==================

# mod-dpssim: first-party DPS sim daemon, bespoke to this server's custom stat system and core
# patches (see .agents/plans/dps-sim-module/) — tracked in this repo, not a separate module repo.
!modules/mod-dpssim
modules/mod-dpssim/reports/*
modules/mod-dpssim/conf/profiles/.stat-weights-scratch/

# Live-stack e2e private / local tooling (scratch tests stay uncommitted)
